[00:25.668] Out of breath, on all fours
[00:31.893] Felt good in the moment, nothing more
[00:38.617] Water for chamomile, clothes on the floor
[00:44.941] Feels like I've been here or met you before, no
[00:51.292] You're just a shadow, a shape in the door
[00:57.450] Leaving me lonely, leaving me sore
[01:03.592]
[01:03.836] Love is so simple and so hard to find
[01:10.017] I look for it in pictures, I look for it in wine
[01:15.033] The bottles are empty and nothing is mine
